	(text "Every channel board plugs in with bottom-side pin headers; the sockets and M2 holes below sit exactly under them.\nBoard slots on the PCB (y, mm): INPUT 34-129, EQ 129.5-309.5, COMP 310-346 (board turned 90 deg, 25 x 36), PAN/FADER 346.5-452.5; channel slot x = 20.35 / 56.72 / 93.22 / 129.51.\nNet names: CHn_<signal> = channel n only.  MIX_L+/-, MIX_R+/- = shared mix bus (all channels in parallel).  Power: +48V, +15V, -15V, +3V3, GND.\nAlready wired per channel: INPUT_OUT -> EQ in and pan/fader AUDIO_PRE_EQ;  EQ_OUT -> pan/fader AUDIO_IN.\nNot yet wired (labels only): CVs and logic from the DAC/controller, ENV_ADC, DET_IN source, insert send/return, mic/line/Hi-Z jacks, channel aux sends."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b762a8fd-0e82-4fcb-a984-3a8311a3f7be")
	)
